PIANO_RH_STAFF → PIANO_RH_OPEN INSTRUMENT_NAME MIDI_INSTRUMENT TEMPO KEY TIME CLEF_TREBLE DYNAMIC STAFF_MUSIC STAFF_CLOSE
{
